  "source": {
    "note": "Facts consolidated from six independently inspected references below. No third-party source code is reproduced in this file or in src/app/features/imbuements.js; item names, quantities, tier bonus text and fee/token amounts are game facts, not the expression copied from any single reference. Full narrative in docs/imbuements-sources.md.",
    "references": [
      {
        "url": "https://www.tibia.com/news/?id=8396&subtopic=newsarchive",
        "publisher": "CipSoft (official Tibia news)",
        "date": "2025-06-12",
        "role": "primary and authoritative source that the success-chance boost mechanic was removed: every imbuement tier is now 100% success, at fixed per-tier fees of 7500gp (Basic), 60000gp (Intricate) and 250000gp (Powerful), and that the current catalog has 24 imbuement types. This supersedes tierFees and both community-repo fee figures below, which predate this patch; it also confirms TibiaPal's 60000gp Intricate figure was correct all along, not exiva-xp's pre-patch 55000gp."
      },
      {
        "url": "https://tibia.fandom.com/wiki/Punch",
        "publisher": "TibiaWiki (Fandom)",
        "role": "primary for the newly added Punch imbuement (Fist Fighting): Basic +1 Fist Fighting (25 Tarantula Egg), Intricate +2 (adds 20 Mantassin Tail), Powerful +4 (adds 15 Gold-Brocaded Cloth), and that Punch does not support gold-token exchange."
      },
      {
        "url": "https://tibia.fandom.com/wiki/Imbuing",
        "publisher": "TibiaWiki (Fandom)",
        "role": "corroborates the current 24-imbuement-type catalog (including Punch) and general imbuing mechanics; used to cross-check the type list against exiva-xp's 23-type snapshot."
      },
      {
        "url": "https://tibia.fandom.com/wiki/Powerful_Strike",
        "publisher": "TibiaWiki (Fandom)",
        "date": "2025-07-21",
        "role": "resolves this dataset's earlier Strike disagreement: the page's own revision history shows its Powerful Strike effect figures were corrected on 2025-07-21 from 10% chance / 50% damage to 5% chance / 40% damage, matching exiva-xp's '+40% damage (5% chance)' figure. The tibiawiki-sql fixture below captured the page's pre-2025-07-21, now-outdated numbers; the 'uncertain' flag this dataset previously carried on imbuements[strike].tiers.powerful is removed."
      },
      {
        "repository": "https://github.com/nesleykent/exiva-xp",
        "revision": "1d65728c7f3a720972d5b8c6be7085c6ca32c9bf",
        "file": "assets/js/engine/imbuements.js",
        "role": "primary for the pre-existing 23 imbuements' item lists, quantities, tier bonus text and the gold-token-support flag. That file's own header states it was checked against each tier's TibiaWiki `{{Infobox Imbuement}}` template on 2026-07-06, after an earlier pass sourced from a third-party guide produced wrong items for some imbuements. Treated here as evidence of game facts only; no code from it is reused. Its fee figures predate the 2025-06-12 patch above and are no longer used."
      },
      {
        "repository": "https://github.com/PawelKusnierek/TibiaPal",
        "revision": "899d3720e46c36e0eb9e35c6147bf4191ccc69cd",
        "file": "scripts/imbue.js",
        "license": "MIT",
        "notice": "third-party/TibiaPal-LICENSE.txt",
        "role": "corroborates Vampirism/Strike/Void item names and quantities and the 2/4/6 gold-token counts per tier. Also the source of the 20-hour active-duration assumption: its per-hour figures divide each tier's total cost by 20. Its 60000gp Intricate fee figure, once flagged here as an unresolved disagreement with exiva-xp, is now confirmed by the 2025-06-12 official patch note above."
      },
      {
        "repository": "https://github.com/Galarzaa90/tibiawiki-sql",
        "revision": "e46b2d346303af0e7a0deb892a88ad707735171b",
        "files": [
          "tibiawikisql/models/imbuement.py",
          "tibiawikisql/schema.py",
          "tests/resources/content_imbuement.txt"
        ],
        "role": "schema-only corroboration that an imbuement's materials are discrete item/amount pairs. Its single bundled fixture (a Powerful Strike infobox, captured before TibiaWiki's 2025-07-21 correction) was used as an independent cross-check and originally surfaced the now-resolved Strike bonus-text discrepancy; code and schema were inspected for structure only, nothing was copied."
      }
    ],
    "uncertainties": [
      "Neither the official 2025-06-12 patch note nor the TibiaWiki Imbuing/Punch pages restate the 2/4/6 gold-token quantities per tier; those figures are retained from the pre-patch exiva-xp/TibiaPal community sources and have not been independently reverified against the current game version.",
      "Gold-token exchange support (confirmed only for Vampirism, Void and Strike, and explicitly absent for Punch) is likewise carried over from the pre-patch community sources and not reconfirmed by the 2025-06-12 official note, which addresses fees and success chance only, not token exchange."
    ],
    "resolvedUncertainties": [
      "Intricate guaranteed-success fee (previously flagged: exiva-xp's 55000gp vs TibiaPal's 60000gp): resolved 2025-06-12 by official Tibia news — TibiaPal's 60000gp was correct; both are now superseded anyway by the same patch's fee restructure (Basic dropped to 7500gp, Intricate confirmed at 60000gp, Powerful unchanged at 250000gp).",
      "Powerful Strike bonus (previously flagged: exiva-xp's +40%/5% vs the tibiawiki-sql fixture's implied +50%/10%): resolved by TibiaWiki's own 2025-07-21 correction of the Powerful Strike page to +40% damage / 5% chance, matching exiva-xp; the fixture had simply captured a stale, pre-correction revision."
    ]
  },
